```

## Exit Procedures

To exit the calculator, enter `q` when prompted for an operation or expression.

## Troubleshooting

If you encounter any issues while using the Calculator, please check the following:

- Ensure that Python 3.x is installed on your system.
- Verify that all dependencies are correctly installed by running `pip install -r requirements.txt`.
- If you receive an error message, review the error details and try to identify the cause of the issue.

If you're unable to resolve the problem, please contact the project maintainers for assistance.
